{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>A favorite nonogram puzzle game for over 16 years, Pixelogic is finally making its way to Steam!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Pixelogic is a challenging yet chill nonogram game (a.k.a. picross, griddlers, or paint-by-numbers) where you use numeric clues to uncover a hidden picture. No cartoon characters or gimmicks, just pure puzzles.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Use Logic to Reveal a Hidden Picture</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Like a combination of sudoku and mine sweeper, use numeric clues and deductive reasoning to reveal a hidden picture.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/2d09c3ffbd09cfeacc4e1b6714082f53.poster.avif?t=1762965861\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/2d09c3ffbd09cfeacc4e1b6714082f53.webm?t=1762965861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/2d09c3ffbd09cfeacc4e1b6714082f53.mp4?t=1762965861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >6,000+ Human-Made Puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unlimited access to 16+ years of past daily and weekly puzzles. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/665f844f8b0969620e2a529a468b18bc.poster.avif?t=1762965861\" width=800 height=362 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/665f844f8b0969620e2a529a468b18bc.webm?t=1762965861\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/extras/665f844f8b0969620e2a529a468b18bc.mp4?t=1762965861\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Two new puzzles each day + an extra large  puzzle each week</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50  Unlimited access to back catalog of 6,000+ past daily puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50  Choose your challenge from Easy (5x5) to Expert (25x25)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Know where you rank with worldwide statistics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Create and share your own puzzles with included full-featured puzzle creator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Dark mode, themes, &amp; customize colors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Play how you want: mouse, keyboard, touch or gamepad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Steam deck support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet connection required for daily featured puzzles and featured puzzle archive.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"First Puzzle","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677530/db36ebb2453fe6399348cf1fff4c22e2f22ae2b8.jpg"},{"name":"5x5 Starter Pack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677530/4f7b6b653db5e8b3957655abee961ebca8ff0199.jpg"},{"name":"10x10 Starter Pack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677530/495c16abcf542c5fc98544df6e386faee2f721af.jpg"},{"name":"15x15 Starter Pack","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677530/e1c7b721d8fcf183b54eef64cbb9da7f7ad590d7.jpg"},{"name":"5x5 Puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677530/d1c2bff827bb4954c179175d91d7fe72dff93cf6.jpg"},{"name":"10x10 Puzzles","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3677530/b40e8f552487e58df3636a7ee0b99f