></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Two new puzzles each day + an extra large  puzzle each week</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50  Unlimited access to back catalog of 6,000+ past daily puzzles</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50  Choose your challenge from Easy (5x5) to Expert (25x25)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Know where you rank with worldwide statistics</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Create and share your own puzzles with included full-featured puzzle creator</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Dark mode, themes, &amp; customize colors</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Play how you want: mouse, keyboard, touch or gamepad</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u2b50 Steam deck support</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Internet connection required for daily featured puzzles and featured puzzle archive.</p>","developers":["okayest! studios"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3677530/fc0c665a6b2a2581151cea2c476e1184ec404857/header.jpg?t=1762965861","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> macOS 11 or later<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM</li></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3677530/742624654/edfc58a0dc173500d0825d8d4976d68a4452f8ea/1762965058/dash_av1.mpd?t=1762965859","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3677530/742624654/edfc58a0dc173500d0825d8d4976d68a4452f8ea/1762965058/dash_h264.mpd?t=17